# Waking Dreams (windurst 93): the guard's mission side. CoP 3-5 Darkness Named itself current before login: it is not
# below the current mission, so it does not count as completed; Kerutoto plays his default 306 (and a trade does
# nothing). The other side (CoP 4-1 Sheltering Doubt current: 918) is the main flow.
lists WindurstWaters/Kerutoto/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Kerutoto/onTrade
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=13.0,-4.71,-155.9
mission Cop DarknessNamed current
quest Windurst.FoodForThought completed
item BoneChip
login
trade Kerutoto BoneChip x1              # available, the guard false: nothing
trigger Kerutoto                        # Darkness Named current, not completed: not met; his default 306
finish
